msgstr "นี่คือกระดานปูพื้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER"
