msgstr "เก็บสิ่งนั้นให้ห่างจากฉัน!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "This could be useful."
msgstr "สิ่งนี้อาจมีประโยชน์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "I think I can tinker with it even more."
msgstr "ฉันคิดว่าฉันสามารถแก้ไขมันได้มากกว่าเดิม"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL"
