#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.SOMEONEELSESBEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.SOMEONEELSESBEEFALO"
