msgstr "นั่นคงเป็นสัตว์ของคนอื่น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.SLAUGHTER.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.SLAUGHTER.TOOFAR"
msgid "I don't know if I can catch up."
msgstr "ฉันไม่รู้ว่าจะทันไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.START_CARRAT_RACE.NO_RACERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.START_CARRAT_RACE.NO_RACERS"
msgid "Pardonnez-moi, I was so excited I forgot to find a racer!"
