msgstr "มันจะหั่นแฮมได้ไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT"
