#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
