#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH"
