msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE"
msgid "Hmph. What makes him think he's qualified to pass judgement?"
msgstr "หืม อะไรทำให้เขาคิดว่าเขามีคุณสมบัติที่จะผ่านการตัดสิน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM"
msgid "Oh good, something more to build."
msgstr "ดี มีอะไรให้สร้างมากกว่านี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It's of no use to me like this."
msgstr "แบบนี้ฉันไม่มีประโยชน์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It requires an offering."
msgstr "ต้องมีการเสนอ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's ready."
msgstr "พร้อมแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT"
msgid "Useless."
msgstr "ไร้ประโยชน์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC"
msgid "An underling must be able to follow directions."
msgstr "ลูกน้องต้องสามารถทำตามคำแนะนำได้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT"
msgid "The training seems to be progressing well."
msgstr "ดูเหมือนว่าการฝึกจะดำเนินไปได้ด้วยดี"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM"
msgid "My Carrat requires some direction."
msgstr "My Carrat ต้องการทิศทางบางอย่าง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT"
msgid "Useless."
msgstr "ไร้ประโยชน์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC"
msgid "You never know what might pop up on the race track."
msgstr "คุณไม่มีทางรู้หรอกว่าจะมีอะไรโผล่ขึ้นมาในสนามแข่ง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT"
msgid "Hm. I'm getting a sudden craving for popcorn..."
msgstr "หืม จู่ๆก็อยากกินป๊อปคอร์น..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM"
msgid "It would be prudent to place this somewhere."
msgstr "ควรวางสิ่งนี้ไว้ที่ใดที่หนึ่งอย่างระมัดระวัง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT"
msgid "Useless."
msgstr "ไร้ประโยชน์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "Athletics were never my strong suit."
msgstr "กรีฑาไม่เคยเหมาะกับฉันเลย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT"
msgid "It's rather amusing to watch it scurry."
msgstr "มันค่อนข้างน่าขบขันที่จะดูมันอย่างรวดเร็ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM"
msgid "I should construct this, posthaste."
msgstr "ฉันควรสร้างสิ่งนี้ posthaste"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT"
msgid "Useless."
msgstr "ไร้ประโยชน์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC"
msgid "An exercise machine... the most dastardly of inventions."
msgstr "เครื่องออกกำลังกาย...สิ่งประดิษฐ์ที่ขี้ขลาดที่สุด"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT"
msgid "You will thank me for making you stronger."
msgstr "คุณจะขอบคุณฉันที่ทำให้คุณแข็งแกร่งขึ้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM"
msgid "I tire of lugging this around."
msgstr "ฉันเบื่อที่จะต้องแบกรับสิ่งนี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "These posts will serve as adequate route markers."
msgstr "ข้อความเหล่านี้จะทำหน้าที่เป็นตัวระบุเส้นทางที่เพียงพอ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "The dumb little creatures would be lost without them."
msgstr "สิ่งมีชีวิตตัวน้อยที่โง่เขลาจะหายไปหากไม่มีพวกมัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "I've no use for it anymore."
msgstr "ฉันไม่ใช้มันแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Such frivolity."
msgstr "ความเหลื่อมล้ำเช่นนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "I'd almost forgotten the sweet taste of victory."
msgstr "ฉันเกือบลืมรสหวานแห่งชัยชนะไปแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "{winner}'s racer was... superior to mine..."
msgstr "นักแข่งของ {winner} นั้น... เหนือกว่าของฉัน..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "End of the line, pal."
msgstr "สุดสายแล้วเพื่อน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "I suppose this is what I must do for entertainment now."
msgstr "ฉันคิดว่านี่คือสิ่งที่ฉันต้องทำเพื่อความบันเทิงในตอนนี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "Might as well start things off with a bang. Or a gong."
msgstr "อาจจะเริ่มต้นด้วยการปัง หรือฆ้องก็ได้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "It's worthless now."
msgstr "ตอนนี้มันไร้ค่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "A disappointing performance."
msgstr "ผลงานที่น่าผิดหวัง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "Excellent. You've done well."
msgstr "ยอดเยี่ยม คุณทำได้ดี"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "I will only accept the finest Carrat."
msgstr "ฉันจะยอมรับเฉพาะ Carrat ที่ดีที่สุดเท่านั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "It seems some assembly is required."
msgstr "ดูเหมือนว่าจำเป็นต้องมีการประกอบบางอย่าง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "I will reap what I sow."
msgstr "ฉันจะเก็บเกี่ยวสิ่งที่ฉันหว่าน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "This should yield a higher quality crop."
msgstr "สิ่งนี้ควรให้ผลผลิตคุณภาพสูงกว่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR"
msgid "Such exquisite craftsmanship. Into the water it goes."
msgstr "เป็นงานฝีมือที่วิจิตรงดงาม ลงไปในน้ำ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "Can't someone else assemble it?"
msgstr "คนอื่นประกอบมันไม่ได้เหรอ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Move along. Show's over."
msgstr "เดินหน้าต่อไป การแสดงจบแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Charcoal? How imaginative."
msgstr "ถ่านเหรอ? ช่างจินตนาการเหลือเกิน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Great."
msgstr "เยี่ยมมาก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid "Must I?"
msgstr "ฉันต้อง?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "That's the place for the person in charge. Me."
msgstr "นั่นคือที่ของผู้รับผิดชอบ ฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "Hard labor? Isn't that Winona's forte?"
msgstr "ทำงานหนักเหรอ? นั่นไม่ใช่จุดแข็งของ Winona เหรอ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "Ah. I do enjoy a nice meal."
msgstr "อ่า ฉันชอบทานอาหารดีๆนะ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "Ugh. More fit for a creature than for me."
msgstr "อ๊ะ เหมาะกับสิ่งมีชีวิตมากกว่าฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "Nothing fancy, but it will do."
msgstr "ไม่มีอะไรหรูหราแต่จะทำได้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "Such unrefined decor."
msgstr "การตกแต่งที่ไม่ประณีตเช่นนี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
msgid "Now it's not even useful."
msgstr "ตอนนี้มันไม่มีประโยชน์ด้วยซ้ำ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM"
msgid "Someone should set that up."
msgstr "ควรมีคนตั้งค่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "Such unrefined decor."
msgstr "การตกแต่งที่ไม่ประณีตเช่นนี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "Now it's not even useful."
msgstr "ตอนนี้มันไม่มีประโยชน์ด้วยซ้ำ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "Someone should set that up."
msgstr "ควรมีคนตั้งค่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Absolutely not."
msgstr "ไม่อย่างแน่นอน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING"
msgid "I do enjoy watching people make fools of themselves."
msgstr "ฉันชอบดูผู้คนหลอกตัวเอง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
msgid "Surely that's a job for someone else?"
msgstr "นี่เป็นงานของคนอื่นใช่ไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1"
msgid "Cake shaped like a rabbit, how novel."
msgstr "เค้กรูปร่างเหมือนกระต่าย ช่างแปลกใหม่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2"
msgid "What a mysterious flavor."
msgstr "ช่างเป็นรสชาติที่ลึกลับจริงๆ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3"
msgid "A small piece of fruit, imprisoned in gelatin."
msgstr "ผลไม้ชิ้นเล็กๆขังอยู่ในเจลาติน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4"
msgid "Far too sticky for my liking."
msgstr "เหนียวเกินไปสำหรับฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "A pity."
msgstr "น่าเสียดาย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It requires an offering."
msgstr "ต้องมีข้อเสนอ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What do you have in store for me?"
msgstr "คุณมีอะไรจะฝากฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN"
msgid "Care for a gentleman's duel?"
msgstr "สนใจการดวลของสุภาพบุรุษไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste."
msgstr "สิ้นเปลืองจริงๆ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "Nice post."
msgstr "โพสต์ที่ดี"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM"
msgid "I have to do everything!"
msgstr "ฉันต้องทำทุกอย่าง!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "My money is on Little Miss Pyro."
msgstr "ฉันวางเงินเดิมพันให้กับ Little Miss Pyro"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Greedy little worm, aren't you?"
msgstr "เจ้าหนอนน้อยตะกละใช่มั้ยล่ะ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC
