msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS"
msgid "Someone could trip and break their neck. Pretty though."
msgstr "ใครบางคนอาจสะดุดล้มแล้วคอหักได้ แต่ก็สวยดีนะ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP"
msgid "I suppose it has its uses."
msgstr "ฉันคิดว่ามันมีประโยชน์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE"
