#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO"
msgid "Rude."
msgstr "หยาบคาย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES"
msgid "That did it!"
msgstr "นั่นมัน!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL"
msgid "Looks like stuff I already know."
msgstr "ดูเหมือนเป็นสิ่งที่ฉันรู้อยู่แล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH"
msgid "Ouch! What the heck was that?!"
msgstr "โอย! นั่นมันอะไรเนี่ย?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX"
msgid "Did anyone else see that weird glow?"
msgstr "มีใครเห็นแสงประหลาดนั่นไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER"
msgid "You're good for something besides burning after all."
msgstr "คุณมีประโยชน์อย่างอื่นนอกเหนือจากการเผาไหม้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_BLOSSOM"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_EVIL"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SNARED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SNARED"
msgid "Gross, ew! Bones!"
msgstr "แย่จัง อี๋! Bones!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY"
msgid "Hey, knock it off!"
msgstr "เฮ้ เลิกยุ่งได้แล้ว!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW"
msgid "There's no snow here."
msgstr "ที่นี่ไม่มีหิมะ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG"
msgid "It's useless to try and roll it any bigger."
msgstr "การลองและกลิ้งมันให้ใหญ่ไปก็ไร้ประโยชน์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED"
msgid "Ugh, this is the WORST!"
msgstr "อ๊ะ นี่มันแย่ที่สุด!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED"
