msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "I don't think I'm supposed to spend this."
msgstr "ฉันไม่คิดว่าฉันควรจะใช้เงินนี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "We could be good friends, you and I."
msgstr "เราอาจจะเป็นเพื่อนที่ดีต่อกัน คุณและฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "I should burn that thing before it reaches full ugliness."
msgstr "ฉันควรจะเผาสิ่งนั้นก่อนที่จะถึงความอัปลักษณ์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG"
msgid "Ew, ew, ew!! Too many eyes!!"
msgstr "อี๋ อี๋ อี๋!! เยอะเกินตา!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT"
msgid "How am I supposed to see in that thing?"
msgstr "ฉันจะมองเห็นสิ่งนั้นได้อย่างไร"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "Can I burn it now?"
msgstr "ฉันเขียนตอนนี้ได้ไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT"
msgid "Do I look like the kind of person who fixes things? Ugh, fiiiiine..."
msgstr "ฉันดูเหมือนคนที่แก้ไขสิ่งต่างๆไหม อืม fiiiine..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL"
msgid "I like the way it glitters."
msgstr "ฉันชอบที่มันระยิบระยับ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "Uh... is that supposed to be here?"
msgstr "เอ่อ... ควรจะอยู่ที่นี่หรือเปล่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT"
msgid "Ew, that thing's creepy!"
msgstr "เอ้ มันน่าขนลุก!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END"
msgid "It's asking for a taste of my lighter."
msgstr "มันขอชิมไฟแช็กของฉันหน่อย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE"
msgid "What gives? That little fire doesn't even feel warm!"
msgstr "ให้อะไร? ไฟเล็กๆนั้นไม่แม้แต่จะอุ่น!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "Right. Now I guess I have to build it."
msgstr "ใช่แล้ว ตอนนี้ฉันเดาว่าฉันต้องสร้างมัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER"
msgid "Ew, it's dripping its weird sleep gunk everywhere!"
msgstr "เอ้ มันหยดสลีปนอนแปลกๆทุกที่เลย!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED"
msgid "It's kinda nice to stare into."
msgstr "มันดีจริงๆ ที่ได้จ้องมอง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "I bet a quick fire would take care of this."
msgstr "ฉันพนันได้เลยว่าการยิงด่วนจะจัดการเรื่องนี้ได้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "Gross! It's so meaty!"
msgstr "แย่จัง! เนื้อมันมาก!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK"
msgid "It actually looks pretty tasty."
msgstr "มันดูน่าอร่อยจริงๆ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "I like the fire!"
msgstr "ฉันชอบไฟ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST"
msgid "What do you think would happen if I threw a lit match inside?"
msgstr "คุณคิดว่าจะเกิดอะไรขึ้นถ้าฉันโยนไม้ขีดไฟข้างใน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS"
msgid "Uh... nice bird?"
msgstr "เอ่อ... นกสวยไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK"
msgid "Nasty."
msgstr "น่ารังเกียจ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER"
msgid "Ha! That thing was just a featherweight after all."
msgstr "ฮ่า! ตอนนั้นมันก็แค่เฟเธอร์เวทเวท"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE"
msgid "That took way too much effort."
msgstr "นั่นใช้ความพยายามมากเกินไป"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "He looks scared half to death."
msgstr "เขาดูกลัวแทบตาย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "Why did this plant have a face?"
msgstr "ทำไมต้นไม้ต้นนี้ถึงมีหน้า?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "The face doesn't wash away!!"
msgstr "หน้าไม่ล้าง!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "Now that's just creepy!"
msgstr "ตอนนี้มันน่าขนลุก!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "The fire made this plant guy a lot quieter."
msgstr "ไฟทำให้ต้นไม้นี้เงียบลงมาก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "That's not a normal plant."
msgstr "นั่นไม่ใช่พืชธรรมดา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "The rabbits lost that argument."
msgstr "กระต่ายแพ้ข้อโต้แย้งนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "Nothing's on it? I can burn it then, right?"
msgstr "ไม่มีอะไรบนนั้น? ฉันเผามันได้ใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "It's heavy!"
msgstr "มันหนัก!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "I guess we just... plant it? In the dirt?"
msgstr "ฉันเดาว่าเราแค่... ปลูกมัน? ในดิน?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "That makes no sense!"
msgstr "มันไม่สมเหตุสมผล!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "I wonder if the rest burnt down."
msgstr "ฉันสงสัยว่าส่วนที่เหลือถูกไฟไหม้มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "What sort of bush doesn't burn?!"
msgstr "พุ่มไม้ประเภทใดที่ไม่ไหม้!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "The worst kind of tree. The non-flammable kind."
msgstr "ต้นไม้ที่เลวร้ายที่สุด ชนิดที่ไม่ติดไฟ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Burn, thorns!"
msgstr "เผาไหม้ หนาม!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT"
msgid "That burned way too quickly."
msgstr "นั่นแผดเผาเร็วเกินไป"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks sharp."
msgstr "มันดูเฉียบคม"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Those thorns hurt!"
msgstr "หนามพวกนั้นเจ็บ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "It's all plant-y."
msgstr "มันคือพืชทั้งหมด"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "YES! BURN!"
msgstr "ใช่! เบิร์น!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "I wish it was still burning."
msgstr "ฉันหวังว่ามันจะยังไหม้อยู่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Not so spiky now, are you?"
msgstr "ตอนนี้ไม่แหลมมากแล้วใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks dangerous!"
