#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM"
