msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN"
msgid "Don't recognize the song. Maybe it wasn't released in Canada."
msgstr "ไม่รู้จักเพลง บางทีมันอาจจะไม่ได้ออกในแคนาดา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED"
msgid "Don't recognize the song. Maybe it wasn't released in Canada."
msgstr "จำเพลงนี้ไม่ได้ อาจจะไม่ได้เปิดตัวในแคนาดา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BATWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BATWING"
msgid "Gross!"
msgstr "แย่จัง!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED"
msgid "Gross! And tasty! So confusing!"
msgstr "แย่จัง! และอร่อย! สับสนมาก!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR"
msgid "My hair's not that colour. Not my beard, anyway."
msgstr "ผมของฉันไม่ใช่สีนั้น ยังไงก็เคราของฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGER"
msgid "That's a big bear!"
msgstr "นั่นมันหมีตัวใหญ่!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Smokey!"
msgstr "สโมคกี้!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "He's a whole lotta backbacon."
msgstr "เขาเป็นแบ็คเบคอนตัวหนึ่ง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Well that's no good, eh?"
msgstr "มันไม่ดีใช่มั้ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK"
msgid "Keeps things nice and frosty, eh?"
msgstr "ทำให้ทุกอย่างสวยงามและหนาวจัดใช่ไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST"
msgid "Now this is some proper winter gear."
msgstr "นี่คืออุปกรณ์กันหนาวที่เหมาะสม"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR"
msgid "It's as thick as my head!"
msgstr "มันหนาเท่าหัวของฉัน!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Our beast is lucky it ended up being our friend and not our dinner, eh?"
msgstr "โชคดีที่อสูรของเราเป็นเพื่อนเรา ไม่ใช่อาหารเย็นใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY"
msgid "I love camping."
msgstr "ฉันชอบตั้งแคมป์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW"
msgid "I slept on worse back at the lumber camp."
msgstr "ฉันนอนดึกที่แคมป์ตัดไม้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC"
msgid "She's making the flowers grow."
msgstr "เธอกำลังทำให้ดอกไม้เติบโต"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD"
msgid "Now what do I do with her?"
msgstr "ตอนนี้ฉันจะทำอย่างไรกับเธอดี"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT"
msgid "No, not the bees!"
msgstr "ไม่ใช่ ไม่ใช่ผึ้ง!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY"
msgid "Maple syrup substitute!"
msgstr "ทดแทนน้ำเชื่อมเมเปิ้ล!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Buzzers!"
msgstr "เสียงกริ่ง!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY"
msgid "I'm getting hungry just looking at it."
msgstr "แค่มองดูก็หิวแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY"
msgid "Maple syrup substitute!"
msgstr "ทดแทนน้ำเชื่อมเมเปิ้ล!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY"
msgid "I could get more if I waited."
msgstr "ฉันจะได้มากกว่านี้ถ้าฉันรอ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT"
msgid "No, not the bees!"
msgstr "ไม่ใช่ ไม่ใช่ผึ้ง!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY"
msgid "Maple syrup substitute!"
msgstr "ทดแทนน้ำเชื่อมเมเปิ้ล!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC"
msgid "So that's where those bees are comin' from!"
msgstr "นั่นคือที่มาของผึ้งพวกนั้น!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY"
msgid "I'm getting hungry just looking at it."
msgstr "แค่มองดูก็หิวแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY"
msgid "Maple syrup substitute!"
msgstr "ทดแทนน้ำเชื่อมเมเปิ้ล!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY"
msgid "I could get more if I waited."
msgstr "ฉันจะได้มากกว่านี้ถ้าฉันรอ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD"
msgid "It doesn't look alive."
msgstr "มันดูไม่มีชีวิตชีวา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER"
msgid "It's like losing my second best friend."
msgstr "มันเหมือนกับการสูญเสียเพื่อนที่ดีที่สุดคนที่สองของฉันไป"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED"
msgid "I like this one's attitude."
msgstr "ฉันชอบทัศนคติของคนๆนี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER"
msgid "I think he likes me."
msgstr "ฉันคิดว่าเขาชอบฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "He smells like a sod house."
msgstr "เขามีกลิ่นเหมือนบ้านดิน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER"
msgid "He's a smelly old thing, but I couldn't ask for a better bud!"
msgstr "เขาเป็นคนแก่ที่มีกลิ่นเหม็น แต่ฉันไม่สามารถขอดอกตูมที่ดีกว่านี้ได้!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED"
msgid "Cheer up, eh?"
msgstr "เชียร์ขึ้นใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY"
msgid "Why so glum, chum?"
msgstr "ทำไมหน้าบูดจังวะ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY"
msgid "You're almost as big as a moose!"
msgstr "คุณใหญ่เกือบเท่ากวางมูส!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER"
msgid "I'm sorry, want to go for a ride?"
msgstr "ขอโทษ ไปนั่งรถกันไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "He's catching some zeds."
msgstr "เขากำลังจับ zeds อยู่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED"
msgid "Come and get it!"
msgstr "มาเลย!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT"
msgid "Now I'm the king of the beefalo!"
msgstr "ตอนนี้ฉันเป็นราชาแห่งบีฟาโล่!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT"
msgid "How aboot I give my beefalo something tasty to munch on, eh?"
msgstr "ฉันจะเอาบีฟาโล่ของฉันไปเคี้ยวให้อร่อยได้อย่างไร"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "It feels like my beard."
msgstr "รู้สึกเหมือนเคราของฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT"
msgid "Not much I can do with that."
msgstr "ฉันทำอะไรกับมันได้ไม่มาก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC"
msgid "This seems like a bit much..."
msgstr "ดูเหมือนจะเยอะไปหน่อย..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Well, let's see what I can do."
msgstr "เอาละ มาดูกันว่าฉันจะทำอะไรได้บ้าง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM"
msgid "Better get that set up, eh?"
msgstr "ไปตั้งค่ากันเลยดีกว่าไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL"
msgid "Beefalo sure seem to like the sound it makes."
msgstr "Beefalo ดูเหมือนจะชอบเสียงของมันอย่างแน่นอน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD"
msgid "Hopefully no one's allergic, eh?"
msgstr "หวังว่าจะไม่มีใครเป็นภูมิแพ้ ใช่มั้ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT"
msgid "That'll keep the bees out of yer eyes."
msgstr "นั่นจะทำให้ผึ้งไม่เข้าตา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE"
msgid "They're all comfy-cozy in there."
msgstr "พวกมันทั้งหมดอยู่สบายในนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE"
msgid "I don't know if the bees like this."
msgstr "ฉันไม่รู้ว่าผึ้งเป็นแบบนี้หรือเปล่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL"
msgid "Hey! That's just mean!"
msgstr "เฮ้! นั่นแค่หมายความว่า!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN"
msgid "Bees got no business getting that big."
msgstr "ผึ้งไม่ได้ทำธุรกิจอะไรมากขนาดนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not eating honey off the ground."
msgstr "ฉันไม่ได้กินน้ำผึ้งจากพื้นดิน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING"
msgid "The bees are planning something."
msgstr "ผึ้งกำลังวางแผนอะไรบางอย่าง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN"
msgid "Nature is something else, eh?"
msgstr "ธรรมชาติเป็นอย่างอื่น ใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX"
msgid "Yeesh, that's waxy."
msgstr "ใช่ ขี้เหนียว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY"
msgid "Lucy says she likes my own woody musk."
msgstr "ลูซี่บอกว่าเธอชอบวู๊ดดี้มัสค์ของฉันเอง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR"
msgid "Gotta chop that armor up."
msgstr "ต้องสับเกราะนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BELL"
msgid "I'm amazed it makes such a crisp sound."
msgstr "ฉันทึ่งมากที่เสียงนั้นคมชัด"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE"
msgid "I guess I should be used to weird stuff by now."
msgstr "ฉันว่าฉันน่าจะเคยชินกับของแปลกๆได้แล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG"
msgid "Hm. Yep. Just another day."
msgstr "อืม ใช่ แค่วันอื่น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN"
msgid "Poor lil thing."
msgstr "สิ่งแย่ๆของลิล"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "Cute, isn't it 'Luce?"
msgstr "น่ารัก ใช่มั๊ย 'Luce?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES"
msgid "I have a heartier appetite than that."
msgstr "ฉันมีความอยากอาหารมากกว่านั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED"
msgid "Tastes like warm berries."
msgstr "รสชาติเหมือนผลเบอร์รี่อุ่นๆ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY"
msgid "That's good eatin', eh?"
msgstr "น่ากินจัง ใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED"
msgid "Mmm. These'd be perfect with some syrup."
msgstr "อืม คงจะเหมาะมากกับน้ำเชื่อม"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN"
msgid "It needs a good poopin'."
msgstr "มันต้องมีอึดีๆ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Can't save it now."
msgstr "ไม่สามารถบันทึกได้ในขณะนี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "It's caught a bit of a bug."
msgstr "ตรวจพบข้อบกพร่องเล็กน้อย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "Lookin' a bit down."
msgstr "ก้มหน้าลงหน่อย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "Saskatoon berries?"
msgstr "ผลเบอร์รี่ซัสคาทูน?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED"
msgid "No berries left!"
msgstr "ไม่มีผลเบอร์รี่เหลือ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "It's perished from the heat, eh?"
msgstr "มันตายจากความร้อนแล้วใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN"
msgid "Lookin' pretty barren."
msgstr "ดูแห้งแล้งมาก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING"
msgid "Can't save it now."
msgstr "ไม่สามารถบันทึกได้ในขณะนี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED"
msgid "It's caught a bit of a bug."
msgstr "ตรวจพบข้อบกพร่องเล็กน้อย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING"
msgid "Lookin' a bit down."
msgstr "ก้มหน้าลงหน่อย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC"
msgid "I see a snack."
msgstr "ฉันเห็นขนม"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED"
msgid "Eh, they'll be back."
msgstr "เอ๊ะ พวกมันจะกลับมา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED"
msgid "Dry as the Alberta plains."
msgstr "แห้งเหมือนที่ราบอัลเบอร์ตา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE"
msgid "It's as sweet as you are, Luce."
msgstr "หวานเหมือนเธอเลย ลูซ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA"
msgid "It's got a nice flavour to it."
msgstr "มันมีรสชาติที่ดี"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT"
msgid "Watch where you're stepping!"
msgstr "ดูว่าคุณกำลังก้าวไปที่ไหน!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE"
msgid "I'll chop you too!"
msgstr "ข้าจะสับเจ้าด้วย!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD"
msgid "I'm sorry. I failed you."
msgstr "ฉันขอโทษ ฉันทำพลาด"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Where I try to make birds reform their evil ways."
msgstr "ฉันพยายามทำให้นกปฏิรูปความชั่วร้ายของมันได้ที่ไหน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY"
msgid "I'll get you something to eat soon, buddy."
msgstr "ฉันจะไปหาอะไรให้กินเร็วๆนี้เพื่อน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Think aboot what you've done, bird!"
msgstr "คิดซะว่าทำอะไรลงไป เจ้านก!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON"
msgid "That's starting to smell."
msgstr "นั่นเริ่มมีกลิ่นแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING"
msgid "They look so innocent when they dream."
msgstr "พวกมันดูไร้เดียงสามากเวลาที่พวกเขาฝัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING"
msgid "He's got a hankering for some poutine!"
msgstr "เขาอยากได้ตุ๊กตาหมี!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Finally."
msgstr "ในที่สุด."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I still don't trust it."
msgstr "ฉันยังไม่ไว้ใจมันเลย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "This is the worst."
msgstr "นี่มันเลวร้ายที่สุด"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP"
msgid "I'll show those birds yet!"
msgstr "ฉันยังจะโชว์นกพวกนั้นเลย!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG"
msgid "There's a bird in there, thinking evil bird thoughts."
msgstr "มีนกอยู่ในนั้น กำลังคิดเรื่องนกร้าย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED"
msgid "Well, at least it never became a bird."
msgstr "อย่างน้อย มันก็ไม่เคยกลายเป็นนก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT"
msgid "I always knew they were evil."
msgstr "ฉันรู้อยู่เสมอว่าพวกเขาชั่วร้าย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER"
msgid "See? You can never trust a bird!"
msgstr "เห็นไหม คุณไม่สามารถไว้ใจนกได้!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP"
msgid "It's been a while since my last confession."
msgstr "มันผ่านไประยะหนึ่งแล้วตั้งแต่ฉันสารภาพครั้งสุดท้าย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT"
msgid "Hey now!"
msgstr "เดี๋ยวก่อน!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "I can see the internal workings!"
msgstr "ฉันเห็นการทำงานภายใน!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG"
msgid "I like my flags with a maple leaf on 'em."
msgstr "ฉันชอบธงของฉันที่มีใบเมเปิ้ลติดอยู่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE"
msgid "This seems a bit aggressive."
msgstr "มันดูก้าวร้าวไปหน่อย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA"
msgid "I'm not much of a shot."
msgstr "ฉันไม่ค่อยถนัดนัก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2"
msgid "Someone else'll make better use of it."
msgstr "คนอื่นจะใช้งานได้ดีกว่านี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE"
msgid "Anyone want a demonstration of my impressive lungpower?"
msgstr "มีใครต้องการแสดงพลังปอดที่น่าประทับใจของฉันไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP"
msgid "A couple blows on that and you can escape just aboot anything!"
msgstr "มีคู่หูปะทะกัน และคุณสามารถหลบหนีอะไรก็ได้!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW"
