msgid "Freshly bottled plant food."
msgstr "อาหารจากพืชบรรจุขวดสด"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED"
msgid "Now that's a strong brew!"
msgstr "ตอนนี้กลายเป็นเบียร์ที่เข้มข้นแล้ว!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE"
msgid "Can't rush the brewing process."
msgstr "ไม่สามารถเร่งกระบวนการผลิตเบียร์ได้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED"
msgid "Yup, that right there's the good stuff!"
msgstr "ใช่ นั่นคือสิ่งที่ดี!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "Reminds me of momma!"
msgstr "นึกถึงแม่!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "It lacks the heft of a good solid axe."
msgstr "มันขาดการยกของขวานที่ดี"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "I'd take a stab at it."
msgstr "ฉันจะแทงมัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "I could give it a whirl."
msgstr "ฉันสามารถให้มันวนไปวนมา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "Who needs a spear when you got ol'Luce?"
msgstr "ใครต้องการหอกเมื่อคุณได้ ol'Luce?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING"
msgid "Luce, I swear. Lightning attacks aren't important to me."
msgstr "Luce ฉันสาบาน การโจมตีด้วยสายฟ้าไม่สำคัญสำหรับฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK"
msgid "A handy knapsack for conserving food!"
msgstr "เป้ที่มีประโยชน์สำหรับถนอมอาหาร!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI"
msgid "Yep. That's a spicy sauce."
msgstr "ใช่ นั่นเป็นซอสเผ็ด"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC"
msgid "I suppose some spice couldn't hurt."
msgstr "ฉันคิดว่าเครื่องเทศบางอย่างไม่สามารถทำร้ายได้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT"
msgid "Good fer melting ice, too!"
msgstr "น้ำแข็งละลายก็ดีเหมือนกัน!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR"
msgid "I prefer my syrup to be maple."
msgstr "ฉันชอบน้ำเชื่อมของฉันมากกว่าเมเปิ้ล"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "Good!"
msgstr "ดี!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "That's the biggest spider I've ever seen!"
msgstr "นั่นเป็นแมงมุมที่ใหญ่ที่สุดที่ฉันเคยเห็น!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Careful, now, eh?"
msgstr "ระวัง ใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "Holy Mackinaw! Look at that thing!"
msgstr "ศักดิ์สิทธิ์ Mackinaw! ดูนั่นสิ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER"
msgid "Always gotta support the arts."
msgstr "ต้องสนับสนุนศิลปะเสมอ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "Why would I want to carry that around?"
msgstr "ทำไมฉันถึงอยากพกติดตัวไปด้วย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "I think it's poison."
msgstr "ฉันคิดว่ามันเป็นยาพิษ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "She's a real beaut, ain't she?"
msgstr "เธอสวยจริงๆใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "I should skedaddle before they come out of there."
msgstr "ฉันควรจะเล่นสเก็ตก่อนที่พวกมันจะออกมาจากตรงนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "I should skedaddle before they come out of there."
msgstr "ฉันควรจะเล่นสเก็ตก่อนที่พวกมันจะออกมาจากตรงนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "You're not MY queen!"
msgstr "เธอไม่ใช่ราชินีของฉัน!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "They're smart to live away from the corruption."
msgstr "พวกเขาฉลาดที่จะอยู่ให้ห่างจากการทุจริต"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER"
msgid "It better stay far away if it knows what's good for it."
msgstr "อยู่ให้ห่างจะดีกว่าถ้ามันรู้ว่าอะไรดีสำหรับมัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM"
msgid "Looks like food for a bug."
msgstr "ดูเหมือนอาหารของแมลง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "Tricky devil!"
msgstr "มารเจ้าเล่ห์!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD"
msgid "It's dead, eh?"
msgstr "มันตายแล้วใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't want nothing to do with whatever that is."
msgstr "ฉันไม่ต้องการที่จะทำอะไรกับสิ่งนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING"
msgid "Let sleeping dogs lie, eh?"
msgstr "ปล่อยให้สุนัขที่หลับใหลโกหกใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT"
msgid "A nice bit of woodworking there, kiddo."
msgstr "มีงานไม้ดีๆนิดหน่อย ที่รัก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "Spitting is rude!"
msgstr "ถุยถุยหยาบคาย!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "Great!"
msgstr "เยี่ยม!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "They come in yellow now?"
msgstr "ตอนนี้สีเหลืองมาไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "You're snoozin' fer a bruisin'."
msgstr "คุณกำลังงีบหลับเพราะเจ็บช้ำ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER"
msgid "I respect its affinity for giant trees."
msgstr "ฉันเคารพในความสัมพันธ์ของต้นไม้ยักษ์"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE"
msgid "Planning on havin' a little shindig?"
msgstr "กำลังวางแผนว่าจะเจอเรื่องแย่ๆสักหน่อยไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH"
msgid "I think it's time to throw this out."
msgstr "ฉันคิดว่าถึงเวลาทิ้งสิ่งนี้แล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD"
msgid "Aw, it's Diefenbakered."
msgstr "อ๊ะ นี่มัน Diefenbakered"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "A floating red pinecone!"
msgstr "ต้นสนสีแดงลอยน้ำ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "One day this might be a tree."
msgstr "วันหนึ่ง นี่อาจจะเป็นต้นไม้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON"
msgid "Those spores pop like first of July fireworks!"
msgstr "สปอร์พวกนั้นโผล่ออกมาเหมือนดอกไม้ไฟแรกของเดือนกรกฎาคม!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "We've been visited by a forest sprite, Lucy!"
msgstr "พวกเราได้รับการเยี่ยมเยียนโดยเทพดาแห่งป่า ลูซี่!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "One day this might be a tree."
msgstr "วันหนึ่ง นี่อาจจะเป็นต้นไม้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "A flying blue pinecone!"
msgstr "ไพน์โคนสีเขียวบินได้!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "One day this might be a tree."
msgstr "วันหนึ่ง นี่อาจจะเป็นต้นไม้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SQUID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SQUID"
msgid "Squirmy little guys, eh?"
msgstr "เด็กน้อยตัวสั่น ใช่มั้ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "At least it won't start a forest fire."
msgstr "อย่างน้อยก็ไม่ทำให้เกิดไฟป่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "Well, ain't that something."
msgstr "นั่นไม่ใช่อะไรสักหน่อย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Some kinda plant magic."
msgstr "เวทมนตร์จากพืชบางชนิด"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "I prefer to chop the trees myself."
msgstr "ฉันชอบตัดต้นไม้เองมากกว่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "I really wish I hadn't seen that."
msgstr "ฉันหวังว่าฉันไม่เคยเห็นสิ่งนั้นจริงๆ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "Not my style."
msgstr "ไม่ใช่สไตล์ของฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING"
msgid "Not my style."
msgstr "ไม่ใช่สไตล์ของฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING"
msgid "I really wish I hadn't seen that."
msgstr "ฉันหวังว่าฉันไม่เคยเห็นสิ่งนั้นจริงๆ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "I'm not too interested in rocks."
msgstr "ฉันไม่ค่อยสนใจเรื่องหินเท่าไหร่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "I'm not too interested in rocks."
msgstr "ฉันไม่ค่อยสนใจเรื่องหินเท่าไหร่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "It's a walking anatomy lesson."
msgstr "เป็นบทเรียนกายวิภาคศาสตร์การเดิน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "That fuel stuff's gone to its head."
msgstr "เชื้อเพลิงนั่นพุ่งไปที่หัวของมันแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "Ain't no reason for that to exist."
msgstr "ไม่มีเหตุผลที่จะมีสิ่งนั้นอยู่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP"
msgid "Whatcha say, Luce? Should we see where it leads?"
msgstr "Whatcฮ่า พูด Luce เราควรดูว่ามันนำไปสู่ที่ไหน?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "It had some cool things inside, eh?"
msgstr "ข้างในมันมีอะไรเจ๋งๆใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a curious statue, eh?"
msgstr "นั่นเป็นรูปปั้นที่น่าสงสัยใช่มั้ยล่ะ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "You lost your head, eh?"
msgstr "คุณหายหัวแล้วใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER"
msgid "Back to nature, eh?"
msgstr "กลับสู่ธรรมชาติใช่มั้ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "I'm gonna make fun of him for this later, eh?"
msgstr "ฉันจะล้อเลียนเขาทีหลังใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks pretty fancy."
msgstr "ดูหรูหรามาก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "She's a real tall one, eh?"
msgstr "เธอตัวสูงมากใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "I'm not sure I get it."
msgstr "ฉันไม่แน่ใจว่าเข้าใจไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "Could make a nice planter outta that."
msgstr "ทำกระถางต้นไม้สวยๆได้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "That'll put the shine back on yer axe."
msgstr "นั่นจะคืนความเงางามให้กับขวาน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "I like to know where I'm going."
msgstr "ฉันชอบที่จะรู้ว่าฉันกำลังจะไปไหน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "We should set up the base of the boat first."
msgstr "เราควรตั้งฐานของเรือก่อน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "Ouch! It's pointy."
msgstr "อุ๊ย! มันแหลม"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks a bit hard for my behind."
msgstr "มันดูแข็งไปนิดสำหรับก้นของฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "They're takin' a load off, eh?"
msgstr "พวกเขากำลังพักผ่อนใช่มั้ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "What kind of wood is this?!"
msgstr "นี่มันไม้ประเภทไหนเนี่ย?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "What kind of wood is this?!"
msgstr "นี่มันไม้ประเภทไหนเนี่ย?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN"
msgid "Lucy! Did you do that?"
msgstr "ลูซี่! คุณทำแบบนั้นเหรอ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC"
msgid "We chop, and it collects."
msgstr "เราสับ และมันก็รวบรวม"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "It'll keep the sun off yer head."
msgstr "มันจะทำให้ดวงอาทิตย์ไม่บังศีรษะ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "I'm getting better at cooking."
msgstr "ฉันทำอาหารเก่งขึ้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STUFFING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STUFFING"
msgid "I'm stuffed to the brim!"
msgstr "ฉันอิ่มแล้ว!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "There's a lot of water in there for such a tiny plant."
msgstr "มีน้ำมากสำหรับต้นไม้เล็กๆอย่างนี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "That's a plant, eh?"
msgstr "นั่นมันต้นไม้ใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "Ain't a tree, but ain't bad."
msgstr "ไม่ใช่ต้นไม้ แต่ก็ไม่เลว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "I think I prefer cedar chests."
msgstr "ฉันคิดว่าฉันชอบหีบไม้ซีดาร์มากกว่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "Dangit, this lock won't budge!"
msgstr "Dangit ล็อคนี้จะไม่ขยับ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "Lucy keeps saying I should be more organized."
msgstr "ลูซี่เอาแต่พูดว่าฉันควรจะมีระเบียบมากกว่านี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR"
msgid "It's startin' to look a little unsteady."
msgstr "เริ่มดูไม่มั่นคงแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
msgid "Shucks, I came too late to yell \"timbeerrrrr\"!"
msgstr "แย่จัง ฉันมาสายเกินไปที่จะตะโกน \"ทิมเบียร์\"!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE"
msgid "Tall and sturdy as a redwood."
msgstr "สูงและแข็งแรงดั่งไม้แดง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE"
msgid "It's startin' to look a little unsteady."
msgstr "เริ่มดูไม่มั่นคงแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN"
msgid "Well, that's all she wrote."
msgstr "เธอเขียนแค่นั้นแหละ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE"
msgid "She'll take a few swings, eh, Luce?"
msgstr "เธอจะชิงช้าสักหน่อย เอ๊ะ ลูซ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Needs some more work yet, eh?"
msgstr "ยังต้องการงานอีกหรือ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Needs some more work yet, eh?"
msgstr "ยังต้องการงานอีกหรือ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
msgid "Good eating, that."
msgstr "กินเก่งนะนั่น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "It's not plaid, but it'll do."
msgstr "ไม่ใช่แบบลายสก๊อต แต่จะทำ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO"
msgid "Don't mind if I do!"
msgstr "ไม่เป็นไรถ้าฉันทำ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA"
msgid "Almost makes me forget where I am."
msgstr "เกือบทำให้ฉันลืมว่าฉันอยู่ที่ไหน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "I still prefer my axe."
msgstr "ฉันยังชอบขวานมากกว่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
msgid "Guess that's one way to clear the dishes, eh?"
msgstr "คิดว่านั่นเป็นวิธีหนึ่งในการล้างจานใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "We having company?"
msgstr "เรามีบริษัท?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
msgid "Yep. That's some good lookin' food."
msgstr "ใช่ นั่นเป็นอาหารที่ดูดี"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "Whoops. Not the right food."
msgstr "อ๊ะ ไม่ใช่อาหารที่ถูกต้อง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "It's not quite like the tackle box I had back home."
msgstr "มันไม่เหมือนกับกล่องใส่แท็กเกิลที่ฉันเคยมีที่บ้านเลย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "Hey, there's some great ideas for new tackle on here!"
msgstr "เฮ้ มีไอเดียดีๆเกี่ยวกับแท็กเกิลใหม่ๆที่นี่!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "Been a while since I went on a fishing trip."
msgstr "ฉันไปเที่ยวตกปลามาสักพักแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "Sugary good."
msgstr "หวานกำลังดี"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "I don't trust birds that can't fly, either."
msgstr "ฉันไม่ไว้ใจนกที่บินไม่ได้เช่นกัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "What's in here?"
msgstr "มีอะไรในนี้?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "It tastes like justice."
msgstr "รสชาติเหมือนความยุติธรรม"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "Too cold for you?"
msgstr "หนาวเกินไปสำหรับคุณหรือเปล่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "It's hatching."
msgstr "มันกำลังฟักออกมา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "Is it crying?"
msgstr "มันร้องไห้เหรอ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "Birds are never prompt."
msgstr "นกไม่เคยแจ้ง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "Anytime now."
msgstr "เมื่อไรก็ได้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "I should steal its egg to teach it a lesson."
msgstr "ฉันควรจะขโมยไข่ของมันเพื่อสอนบทเรียน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "Nothing there."
msgstr "ไม่มีอะไรที่นั่น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS"
msgid "A hearty breakfast and one less bird in the world, what could be better?"
msgstr "อาหารเช้าแสนอร่อยและนกน้อยตัวหนึ่งในโลก อะไรจะดีไปกว่านี้?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TAMALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TAMALES"
msgid "These'll spice up our holiday feast, eh?"
msgstr "พวกนี้จะเติมสีสันให้กับงานฉลองวันหยุดของเราใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "It's growing up to be a jerk, just like its parents."
msgstr "เติบโตขึ้นมาเป็นคนงี่เง่า เหมือนกับพ่อแม่ของมัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Are you ALWAYS hungry?"
msgstr "คุณหิวตลอดเวลาหรือเปล่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "Finally some peace and quiet."
msgstr "ในที่สุดก็มีความสงบสุขบ้าง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "It getting wild with hunger."
msgstr "มันเริ่มหิว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "Needs gems, eh?"
msgstr "ต้องการอัญมณี ใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "It's ready, but am I?"
msgstr "พร้อมแล้ว แต่ฉันล่ะ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "Ready to go, eh?"
msgstr "พร้อมจะไปหรือยัง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a... magic thing, I think."
msgstr "มันเป็น... ของวิเศษ ฉันคิดว่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "There are bits missing, eh?"
msgstr "มีบิตขาดหายไปใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "It's almost ready, eh?"
msgstr "เกือบพร้อมแล้วใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "Box-y, eh?"
msgstr "Box-y ใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "Crank-y, eh?"
msgstr "ข้อเหวี่ยงเหรอ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "Potato-y, eh?"
msgstr "มันฝรั่ง ใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "Ring-y, eh?"
msgstr "ริง-ย ใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "I wonder what this thing does."
msgstr "ฉันสงสัยว่าสิ่งนี้ทำอะไร"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "I don't think it can still be considered a tent."
msgstr "ฉันไม่คิดว่ามันยังถือเป็นเต็นท์ได้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm used to sleeping in worse."
msgstr "ฉันเคยชินกับการนอนดึกกว่านี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "There a squid down there?"
msgstr "มีปลาหมึกอยู่ตรงนั้นไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "It wobbles when you wave it."
msgstr "มันสั่นเมื่อคุณโบกมือ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "I'm blushing!"
msgstr "ฉันหน้าแดง!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "I'm tired of these squids!"
msgstr "ฉันเบื่อปลาหมึกพวกนี้แล้ว!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "It's so big!"
msgstr "มันใหญ่มาก!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "Are those squid babies?"
msgstr "เป็นลูกปลาหมึกเหรอ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "Not even a stump left behind!"
msgstr "ไม่เหลือแม้แต่ตอไม้!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN"
msgid "I've got a feelin' they'll be back."
msgstr "ฉันรู้สึกว่าพวกเขาจะกลับมา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON"
msgid "I've got a bad feelin'..."
msgstr "ฉันรู้สึกไม่ดีเลย..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED"
msgid "That weird tree's firing beams!!"
msgstr "ลำแสงของต้นไม้ประหลาดนั่น!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "That ain't no tree I've seen before."
msgstr "นั่นไม่ใช่ต้นไม้ที่ฉันเคยเห็นมาก่อน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED"
msgid "How aboot we just leave that be, eh?"
msgstr "เราปล่อยให้มันเป็นไปแบบนั้นได้ยังไง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK"
msgid "Trees don't usually do that, eh?"
msgstr "ปกติแล้วต้นไม้ไม่ทำอย่างนั้นเหรอ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste of good lumber."
msgstr "ช่างเป็นการเสียไม้ที่ดีเสียจริง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks just like any other chest now."
msgstr "ตอนนี้ดูเหมือนหน้าอกอื่นๆ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER"
msgid "Wood's not supposed to shine like that, eh?"
msgstr "ไม้ไม่ควรส่องแสงแบบนั้น ใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "It's the wood of the caves!"
msgstr "เป็นป่าของถ้ำ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET"
msgid "Another day, another skeeter."
msgstr "อีกวัน สกีเตอร์อีกตัว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "It's not wood but it'll do."
msgstr "ไม่ใช่ไม้แต่จะทำ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "Someone's trying to give us a leg up."
msgstr "มีคนพยายามยกขาให้เรา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED"
msgid "See you around, bud."
msgstr "แล้วเจอกัน บัดดี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC"
msgid "Must be one of them forest tigers."
msgstr "ต้องเป็นหนึ่งในนั้นคือเสือป่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK"
msgid "You can't be right all the time I guess."
msgstr "คุณไม่สามารถถูกตลอดเวลาได้หรอก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY"
msgid "He's acting awful squirrelly, must be one nearby!"
msgstr "เขาทำตัวเป็นกระรอกที่น่ากลัว ต้องอยู่ใกล้ๆ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "Can't smell any kits around, eh bud?"
msgstr "ไม่มีกลิ่นชุดอุปกรณ์รอบๆเลยเหรอ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS"
msgid "This guy here seems to know what he's doin'."
msgstr "ดูเหมือนว่าผู้ชายคนนี้จะรู้ว่าเขากำลังทำอะไรอยู่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY"
msgid "How aboot we try somewhere else?"
msgstr "เราลองไปที่อื่นดีกว่าไหม?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING"
msgid "Looks like he knows what he's doin'."
msgstr "ดูเหมือนเขาจะรู้ว่ากำลังทำอะไรอยู่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE"
msgid "I think he's workin' with someone else."
msgstr "ฉันคิดว่าเขากำลังทำงานร่วมกับคนอื่นอยู่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED"
msgid "It sure doesn't give up without a fight."
msgstr "แน่นอนว่าจะไม่ยอมแพ้ถ้าไม่มีการต่อสู้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE"
msgid "Never hurts to have some of this stuff around."
msgstr "ไม่ต้องเสียใจที่มีของพวกนี้อยู่รอบตัว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm gonna need a bigger axe."
msgstr "ฉันต้องการขวานที่ใหญ่กว่านี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "Alright, enough playin' around! Get'em Lucy!"
msgstr "เอาล่ะ พอเล่นไปรอบๆ! Get'em Lucy!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "It's a hole."
msgstr "มันเป็นรู"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "It isn't polypore-sonal, I just gotta chop you."
msgstr "ไม่ใช่ polypore-sonal ฉันแค่ต้องสับคุณ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "Is that how trees are born?"
msgstr "ต้นไม้เกิดมาอย่างนั้นหรือ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO"
msgid "That's a nice looking tomato."
msgstr "นั่นเป็นมะเขือเทศที่หน้าตาดี"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "Heartburn city."
msgstr "เมืองอิจฉาริษยา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Maybe I'll squish it up and put it on some chips."
msgstr "บางทีฉันอาจจะบีบมันแล้วใส่มันลงบนชิป"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like new crop seeds to me."
msgstr "ดูเหมือนเมล็ดพืชใหม่สำหรับฉัน"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "It's too fancy."
msgstr "มันแฟนซีเกินไป"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN"
msgid "I'll stick to a nice cozy toque, thanks."
msgstr "ฉันจะใช้ toque ที่แสนสบาย ขอบคุณ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "Trees by torchlight."
msgstr "ต้นไม้ข้างไฟ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE"
msgid "If only I had some ketchup!"
msgstr "ถ้าฉันมีแค่ซอสมะเขือเทศ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "Get a move on."
msgstr "ก้าวต่อไป"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Some sort of sandy transportation."
msgstr "การขนส่งบนผืนทรายบางประเภท"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "Time to get a move on."
msgstr "ได้เวลาเดินหน้าแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "S'got a powerful stink, eh?"
msgstr "มีกลิ่นแรงใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "The perfect snack for a day of chopping."
msgstr "ของว่างที่เหมาะที่สุดสำหรับวันหั่นผัก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "Mighty powerful right hook on that hoser."
msgstr "ขอเกี่ยวขวาอันทรงพลังบนผู้เลี้ยงม้าตัวนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "I won't even pretend to know how that works."
msgstr "ฉันจะไม่แสร้งทำเป็นรู้ว่ามันทำงานอย่างไร"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "Work smarter, eh?"
msgstr "ทำงานอย่างชาญฉลาด ใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE"
msgid "A trap for the forest, by the forest."
msgstr "กับดักของป่า ข้างป่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED"
msgid "Well, that's just dangerous."
msgstr "นั่นมันอันตรายนะ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Just a little starfish, eh?"
msgstr "แค่ปลาดาวตัวเล็กๆใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "This seems a bit rough."
msgstr "ดูจะหยาบไปหน่อย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "That's not playing fair, eh?"
msgstr "นั่นเล่นไม่ยุติธรรมใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "I guess wood does have a downside..."
msgstr "ฉันเดาว่าไม้ก็มีข้อเสีย..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Wood is so handy! Look at all the things you can make!"
msgstr "ไม้มีประโยชน์มาก! ดูทุกสิ่งที่คุณสามารถทำได้!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "Lots of storage, made of quality wood, what more could you ask for?"
msgstr "พื้นที่จัดเก็บมากมาย ทำจากไม้คุณภาพดี คุณยังต้องการอะไรอีก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "Something is not quite right aboot that chest."
msgstr "มีบางอย่างไม่ถูกต้องสำหรับหน้าอกนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "You're asking for a good chop, bud."
msgstr "คุณกำลังขอชิ้นเนื้อดีๆนะบัดดี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION"
msgid "The bigger the tree, the better to chop down!"
msgstr "ยิ่งต้นไม้ใหญ่ ยิ่งโค่น!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT"
msgid "Don't worry Lucy, I'm not trading you in anytime soon."
msgstr "ไม่ต้องกังวล Lucy ฉันจะไม่ขายให้คุณในเร็วๆนี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "I used to play that game."
msgstr "ฉันเคยเล่นเกมนั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "Choppers for old folks."
msgstr "เครื่องสับสำหรับคนชรา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "Quiet, you!"
msgstr "เงียบซะ เจ้า!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "It's all withered."
msgstr "มันเหี่ยวไปหมดแล้ว"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "She looks friendly."
msgstr "เธอดูเป็นมิตร"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "Gaudy as all get-out."
msgstr "ฉูดฉาดเหมือนออกไปทั้งหมด"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "And here I am just a pawn, eh?"
msgstr "และนี่ฉันเป็นแค่เบี้ยใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "And here I am just a pawn, eh?"
msgstr "และนี่ฉันเป็นแค่เบี้ยใช่มั๊ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "It needs to be straightened, eh?"
msgstr "จำเป็นต้องยืดให้ตรงใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "I would have liked this when I was a boy."
msgstr "ฉันคงจะชอบสิ่งนี้เมื่อตอนที่ฉันยังเป็นเด็ก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "It keeps falling over, eh?"
msgstr "มันตกลงมาเรื่อยๆใช่มั้ย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "Much kazoo aboot nothing."
msgstr "คาซูมากมายไม่ทำอะไรเลย"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "Wigfrid keeps using it to \"spar\" with me and Lucy. We're afraid."
msgstr "Wigfrid ใช้มันเพื่อ \"สปาร์\" กับฉันและลูซี่ เราเกรงใจ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "It belongs in a kitchen, not in the woods."
msgstr "อยู่ในครัว ไม่ใช่ในป่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "I'd rather have some proper rope."
msgstr "ฉันอยากได้เชือกที่เหมาะสมกว่านี้"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "Maxwell probably needs that for his fancy shoes."
msgstr "Maxwell อาจต้องการสิ่งนั้นสำหรับรองเท้าอันหรูหราของเขา"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "We should whip up some pumpkin cookies to put in it, eh?"
msgstr "เราควรตีคุกกี้ฟักทองขึ้นมาเพื่อใส่ ใช่มั้ย?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "I already smell like pine and woodchips, according to Lucy."
msgstr "ฉันได้กลิ่นเหมือนต้นสนและเศษไม้แล้ว ตามความเห็นของ Lucy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "Genius! A cup for a proper woodsman."
msgstr "Genius! ถ้วยสำหรับช่างไม้ที่เหมาะสม"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "No point hanging clothes in the woods."
msgstr "ไม่มีประโยชน์ที่จะแขวนเสื้อผ้าในป่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "That one moves diagonally, I think."
msgstr "ฉันคิดว่าอันนั้นขยับในแนวทแยงมุม"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "That's, uh, the rook piece."
msgstr "นั่นคือ เอ่อ ชิ้นโกง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "Reminds me of a story I heard once."
msgstr "เตือนฉันถึงเรื่องที่เคยได้ยินมาครั้งหนึ่ง"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "That one can only move one square at time."
msgstr "อันนั้นสามารถย้ายได้ครั้งละหนึ่งช่องเท่านั้น"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "That's the, uh, horse piece."
msgstr "นั่นคือ เอ่อ ชิ้นส่วนม้า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "I'd rather my future be a surprise."
msgstr "ฉันอยากให้อนาคตของฉันเป็นเซอร์ไพรส์มากกว่า"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "Creepy."
msgstr "น่าขนลุก"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "That right there's a bad time waitin' to happen."
msgstr "นั่นเป็นช่วงเวลาที่เลวร้ายรออยู่"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
